# Allowlist, not denylist: ignore everything, then re-include exactly what ships.
# A denylist silently ships every new dev file someone adds; this cannot.
#
# NOTE: vsce negations win globally, not in order — a later ignore pattern will
# NOT carve an exception out of an earlier `!` rule. So each `!` must be narrow
# enough on its own (hence `out/*.js`, which excludes `out/test/`).
#
# vsce force-includes package.json and the README, but NOT LICENSE or
# CHANGELOG.md, so those are re-included explicitly.
**

!out/*.js
!out/webview.html
!resources/**
!images/icon.png
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
